# MoodMirror – AI-Powered Reflection Journal

**MoodMirror** is a minimal, intelligent journaling app that helps users reflect on their mental and emotional state using AI-powered analysis and trend tracking.

A solo project designed, built, and maintained by John Nwokike, focused on mental clarity, spiritual grounding, and self-awareness through personal journaling.

---

## Features

- Write daily journal entries
- Receive AI-generated insights about your mood and tone
- Visualize emotional trends over time
- Privacy-first: your reflections stay yours

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Tech |
|-------|------|
| Frontend | React.js + Tailwind CSS |
| Backend | Node.js + Express |
| AI | OpenAI API (GPT-4) |
| Database | MongoDB (Atlas) |
| Charts | Chart.js |
| Auth (Future) | Firebase or Auth0 (Optional) |

